        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Luis Enrique, Marc Overmars, Edgar Davids, Patrick Kluivert, Phillip Cocu\n- Organizations: FC Barcelona, Juventus\n- Topics: 2004–05 FC Barcelona season, squad restructuring, player retirement, player transfers, football management\n\nFacts:\n- During the 2004–05 FC Barcelona season, FC Barcelona significantly restructured its squad.\n- During the 2004–05 FC Barcelona season, Luis Enrique and Marc Overmars retired from playing.\n- During the 2004–05 FC Barcelona season, Edgar Davids returned to Juventus.\n- During the 2004–05 FC Barcelona season, Patrick Kluivert and Phillip Cocu left FC Barcelona for new clubs.\n- Luis Enrique Martínez García was born on 8 May 1970.\n- Luis Enrique is a Spanish former professional footballer.\n- Luis Enrique is a current manager.",
